WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.8 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand consistency and governance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Light brand governance keeps things consistent: approval only where the risk justifies it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name one brand owner.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Templates for everyday; approval for sensitive items.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Review the brand with evidence every year.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: posters from templates need no approval; school materials reviewed within two days; names and media statements approved by Tom.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your review rules and annual brand review.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
